      "content": "i get that but i dont really want to call my doctor in the middle of the night or deal with a pharmacy visit right now. i've heard people taking both all the time. like, if i just take a normal dose of benadryl—like one or two pills—along with my regular dose of hydro, is that really going to be a huge problem? it seems like a pretty standard way to help with sleep when you're on pain meds.",
